          "factIndex": 0,
          "refIndex": 0,
          "retainedExtract": "\"These Walls\" has been described by Billboard as \"pondering sex and existence in equal measure; it's a yoni metaphor about the power of peace, with sugar walls being escape and real walls being obstacles.\"",
